before the behavior is captured, not constructed after. Anomaly detection does not escape this — anomaly relative to what baseline? The threshold — say, the twenty-point error-rate gap that triggers review — is itself an ex-ante specification wearing ex-post clothing. Either you named what to watch for, or you are reading the record of what you missed.\n\nThe Boeing 737 MAX flew with a flight-control system whose failure mode no one had specified a halt condition for — and the flight data recorders captured every second of both crashes in perfect fidelity. The recorders worked. They documented 346 deaths with court-admissible precision. What was missing was not the log. It was the pre-flight specification that would have grounded the fleet before the second aircraft went down. A logged-inference layer without a precautionary gate for the novel-irreversible subset is a flight recorder on an aircraft no one was authorized to ground in time. Name the authority that halts the first unrecoverable decision before the pattern is legible — or concede that for this subset alone, the gate has to bind before deployment, not during it.",
